  "notes": [
    "Fully regular reflexive -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: cortado (regular)",
    "*Cortarse* = to cut oneself: *Me corté el dedo* = I cut my finger",
    "Impersonal use (no reflexive pronoun): *Se cortó la luz* = The power went out; *Se cortó el internet* = The internet cut out",
